{"id":11530,"slug":"pro-a-todo-ya-esta-en-puerto-montt","title":"¡Pro a Todo ya está en Puerto Montt!","date":"2026-07-20T20:21:23","excerpt":"Un nuevo paso para el emprendimiento de nuestra comuna. Con mucha alegría compartimos este importante logro de Hellen Sánchez, fundadora de Pro a Todo, quien, gracias a su esfuerzo, perseverancia y espíritu de innovación, continúa abriendo nuevos espacios para comercializar sus productos. Desde hoy, sus deliciosos productos artesanales están disponibles en Primero Café, ubicado en […]","categories":[{"id":33,"name":"Innovación","slug":"innovacion"},{"id":10,"name":"Cultura/Comunidad","slug":"cultura-comunidad"},{"id":370,"name":"Desarrollo social y comunitario","slug":"desarrollo-social-y-comunitario"},{"id":11,"name":"Fomento","slug":"fomento"},{"id":1,"name":"Proyectos","slug":"proyectos"},{"id":34,"name":"Regional","slug":"regional"}],"author":"Redacción Último Bastión","image":"/images/posts/11530.webp","content":"<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"💚\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t94/1/16/1f49a.png\"/> Un nuevo paso para el emprendimiento de nuestra comuna.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Con mucha alegría compartimos este importante logro de Hellen Sánchez, fundadora de Pro a Todo, quien, gracias a su esfuerzo, perseverancia y espíritu de innovación, continúa abriendo nuevos espacios para comercializar sus productos.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Desde hoy, sus deliciosos productos artesanales están disponibles en Primero Café, ubicado en Presidente Ibáñez #35, Puerto Montt, llevando el sabor de nuestra comuna a nuevos consumidores y consolidando el crecimiento de su emprendimiento.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Hellen es una de las usuarias pioneras de la Sala Comunitaria Municipal de Elaboración, un espacio que cuenta con resolución sanitaria y que ha sido clave para fortalecer el desarrollo de emprendimientos locales con valor agregado.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">¡Felicitamos a Hellen por este gran logro y te deseamos mucho éxito en esta nueva etapa!</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"🍓\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/ta9/1/16/1f353.png\"/> Descubre parte de su catálogo:</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"🌿\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t1e/1/16/1f33f.png\"/> Murta deshidratada en polvo.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"🍓\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/ta9/1/16/1f353.png\"/> Conserva de murta.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"🍯\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tfb/1/16/1f36f.png\"/> Mermeladas artesanales en una gran variedad de sabores.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"🥣\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tce/1/16/1f963.png\"/> Granola de maqui, manzana y cranberry, endulzada con miel natural.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"📍\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t2d/1/16/1f4cd.png\"/> Encuéntralos en Primero Café</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"📌\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tac/1/16/1f4cc.png\"/> Presidente Ibáñez #35, Puerto Montt.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"🕘\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tb0/1/16/1f558.png\"/> Lunes a sábado | 09:00 a 18:00 horas.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"📲\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/td8/1/16/1f4f2.png\"/> Solicita el catálogo completo o realiza tu pedido:</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"📞\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t4d/1/16/1f4de.png\"/> WhatsApp: +56 9 3751 9310</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"📱\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t57/1/16/1f4f1.png\"/> Síguela en redes sociales:</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"📸\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tde/1/16/1f4f8.png\"/> Instagram: @Pro.a.todo</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"📘\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/ta0/1/16/1f4d8.png\"/> Facebook: Pro a Todo</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"🤝\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t64/1/16/1f91d.png\"/> Apoyemos el emprendimiento local. Cada compra impulsa el crecimiento de nuestros productores y fortalece el desarrollo económico de nuestra comuna.</p>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-11532\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/pro-03-1024x940.jpg\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/pro-03-1024x940.jpg 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/pro-03-300x275.jpg 300w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/pro-03-768x705.jpg 768w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/pro-03.jpg 1080w\"/></figure>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-11533\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/pro-01-1024x669.jpg\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/pro-01-1024x669.jpg 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/pro-01-300x196.jpg 300w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/pro-01-768x502.jpg 768w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/pro-01.jpg 1441w\"/></figure>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-83 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-11534\" data-id=\"11534\" decoding